Error [jet.RouteMethodTokenRefused]: HTTP route method `POST` is refused
  --> http_route_custom_method_marked.jet:6:20
    |
  6 |     #Server.Custom("POST", "/marked")
    |                    ^^^^^^
 Why: `POST` is a standard method, which registers with its own verb `post`
 Fix: Register a standard method with its own verb (`mux.get`), and give `custom` any other token of letters, digits and !#$%&'*+-.^_`|~.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2808
